{"id":"00306","root":"uni00306_1","name":{"ja":"ソニア","en":"Sonia"},"title":{"ja":"【イメージガールな殺人鬼】","en":"【Image Girl Killer】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【イメージガールな殺人鬼】 ソニア","en":"【Image Girl Killer】 Sonia"},"element":"Science","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2020-03-16","limited":true,"characterId":50,"profile":{"ja":"人魔問わず斬り殺す殺人鬼として、米連国内で恐れられた人物。残虐非道な行いで有名であり、捕まるまでの間に１００人以上の人魔が惨殺された。その残虐さから死刑判決を受けたが、米連の研究者との取引により人造人間になって生まれ変わった。その後は裏の世界に足を踏み入れ、米連に仇なす魔族や人を切り殺している。クールでセクシーな服装が多いソニアだが、任務のためとあらば様々な衣装を着こなす。そんなソニアもさすがに今回の任務の衣装を見たときは困惑したが、抜群のスタイルで難なく着こなし、今では中々気に入っているようだ。なお、その任務を命じられた理由は「名前が似ているから」というものであったとかなかったとか。","en":"They are a ruthless killer who has been feared throughout the country for their ability to slaughter both humans and demons without hesitation. They are notorious for their brutal methods, and over 100 people have been brutally murdered before they were caught. Due to the cruelty of their actions, they were sentenced to death, but they were reborn as an artificial human being after making a deal with a researcher from the country. Since then, they have been active in the underworld, killing demons and people who are enemies of the country. Although Sonia often wears cool and sexy outfits, she can also wear various costumes for her missions. She was even puzzled by her current mission's outfit at first, but she can pull it off with her exceptional style, and now she seems to like it. The reason she was given this mission was supposedly because her name is similar to someone else's."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"蒼桐かこ","forms":[{"id":"uni00306_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[752,1504],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[122,244],"def":[96,192],"spd":[76,76],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","500009"]},{"id":"uni00306_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1104,2208],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[194,388],"def":[142,284],"spd":[76,76],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","500009","500010"]},{"id":"uni00306_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1456,2905],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[266,531],"def":[188,377],"spd":[76,76],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","500009","500010"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]},"500009":{"slot":"skill1","id":500009,"name":{"ja":"らじかせ！"},"hits":7,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、DEFを小ダウンする"}},{"level":2,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、DEFを小ダウンする"}},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、DEFを小ダウンする"}},{"level":4,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、DEFを小ダウンする"}},{"level":5,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、DEFを小ダウンする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 285% Science damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: DEF -15% for 4 turns","icon":"def_down","tag":"debuff"}]},"500010":{"slot":"skill2","id":500010,"name":{"ja":"ミュージックトランス"},"hits":5,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"}},{"level":2,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"}},{"level":3,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"}},{"level":4,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"}},{"level":5,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、ATKを小ダウンする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 465% Science damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: ATK -20% for 4 turns","icon":"atk_down","tag":"debuff"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"すーぱーソニア"},"detail":{"ja":"部隊全体のDEFを極小アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"All allies: DEF +5%","icon":"def_up","tag":"passive"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":2,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00001",160],[1,"blo00004",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",10],[11,"blo00014",10],[12,"blo00001",320],[12,"blo00004",2],[13,"blo00007",10],[13,"blo00008",10],[14,"blo00010",10],[14,"blo00011",10],[15,"blo00013",10],[15,"blo00014",10],[16,"blo00007",10],[16,"blo00008",10],[17,"blo00010",10],[17,"blo00011",10],[18,"blo00013",10],[18,"blo00014",10],[19,"blo00007",10],[19,"blo00008",10],[20,"blo00010",5],[20,"blo00011",15],[20,"blo00012",5],[21,"blo00007",5],[21,"blo00008",15],[21,"blo00009",5],[22,"blo00013",5],[22,"blo00014",15],[22,"blo00015",5],[23,"blo00010",5],[23,"blo00011",15],[23,"blo00012",5],[24,"blo00007",5],[24,"blo00008",15],[24,"blo00009",5],[25,"blo00013",5],[25,"blo00014",15],[25,"blo00015",5],[26,"blo00001",320],[26,"blo00004",1],[27,"blo00007",5],[27,"blo00010",5],[27,"blo00013",5],[28,"blo00007",5],[28,"blo00010",5],[28,"blo00013",5],[29,"blo00007",5],[29,"blo00010",5],[29,"blo00013",5],[30,"blo00007",5],[30,"blo00010",5],[30,"blo00013",5],[31,"blo00001",320],[31,"blo00004",2],[32,"blo00007",5],[32,"blo00010",5],[32,"blo00013",5],[33,"blo00007",5],[33,"blo00010",5],[33,"blo00013",5],[34,"blo00007",5],[34,"blo00010",5],[34,"blo00013",5],[35,"blo00007",5],[35,"blo00010",5],[35,"blo00013",5],[36,"blo00001",320],[36,"blo00004",2],[37,"blo00007",5],[37,"blo00010",5],[37,"blo00013",5],[38,"blo00007",5],[38,"blo00010",5],[38,"blo00013",5],[39,"blo00007",5],[39,"blo00010",5],[39,"blo00013",5],[40,"blo00007",5],[40,"blo00010",5],[40,"blo00013",5],[41,"blo00001",640],[41,"blo00004",2],[42,"blo00007",5],[42,"blo00010",5],[42,"blo00013",5],[43,"blo00007",5],[43,"blo00010",5],[43,"blo00013",5],[44,"blo00007",5],[44,"blo00010",5],[44,"blo00013",5],[45,"blo00007",5],[45,"blo00010",5],[45,"blo00013",5],[46,"blo00001",640],[46,"blo00004",2],[47,"blo00007",5],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00010",5],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00013",5],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00007",5],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00010",5],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00013",5],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00007",5],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00010",5],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00013",5],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00007",5],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00010",5],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00013",5],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"また組んで仕事ができるみたいね、嬉しいわ……なによ、この格好がおかしい？　すーぱーソニアだって言われたけど、どういう意味かしら……","en":"It looks like we're going to be working together again - I'm happy about that... what's with this getup, though? I've been called \"Super Sonia,\" but I wonder what that means..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"今回のお仕事の相手が、この服を着るアイドルのファンらしいわよ。これなら断末魔の声も、嬉しい悲鳴に変わるのかしらね","en":"The target of our current mission is a fan of the idol who wears this outfit. Maybe their dying screams will turn into happy cries instead."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"なぁに、そんな熱っぽく見つめて……あなたもこういう服装のほうが、好みなのかしら？　へぇ……なるほど、参考にしておくわね","en":"What's with that intense stare... do you have a thing for this kind of outfit too? Hmm... I see. I'll keep that in mind."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"私のイメージとは違うと思うけど、こういう服も悪くないわね……私を見ても、一目で私と気づかれないのが、なかなか新鮮だわ","en":"I think this outfit is a bit different from my usual image, but it's not so bad. It's kind of refreshing that people don't recognize me at first glance."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"あなた、この服の当人と会ったことがあるのよね。ふぅん……だからさっきから、そうやって食い入るように見つめてくるのね","en":"You've met the person who wears this outfit before, haven't you? I see... that's why you've been staring at me like that since earlier."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"そうねぇ、この格好で相手をしてあげてもいいわよ……もちろん、私を心から燃え上がらせてくれたら、ねぇ？","en":"Alright, I'll play along with this outfit... but only if you can get me really excited, okay?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"こんなにも殺させるなんて……私を誘っているのかしら？　いいわよ、たっぷり可愛がってあげる……あなたの血はどんな花を咲かせるのかしらね","en":"You're trying to get me to kill, aren't you? That's fine... I'll pamper you instead. I wonder what kind of flower your blood will bloom into."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"ほら、いらっしゃい……私を楽しませてくれたお礼に、白いお花を咲かせてあげるわ♪","en":"Well, come on in... as a reward for pleasing me, I'll make a white flower bloom for you."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00306_1/uni00306_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[50],"scenes":[["chr_0206_r18"]],"stills":[["chr_0206a_r18"]],"obtain":[{"kind":"spark","title":null,"need":30,"start":null,"end":null}],"standardPool":false,"art":{"graphicId":"uni_00306","graphicNum":2,"r18GraphicId":"uni_00306_r18","r18GraphicNum":2,"spineId":"Chr_0206"}}